  "Product-specific licenses": "产品专属许可",
  "Questions about a purchase": "购买相关问题",
  "Receive your products": "接收产品",
  "Request a review": "申请审核",
  "Wait for payment review": "等待付款审核",
  "What if my payment is rejected?": "付款被拒绝怎么办？",
  "Where can I get help?": "在哪里获取帮助？",
  "Your account and orders": "您的账户与订单",
  "After payment approval, your products are delivered manually. Check your order for delivery updates and contact support with your order number when you need help.": "付款批准后由工作人员人工交付产品。请查看订单中的交付进展，需要帮助时提供订单号联系支持。",
  "An administrator reviews your payment manually. Check My purchases for approval or a rejection reason. If rejected, follow the reason and resubmit your evidence.": "管理员人工审核付款。请在“我的购买”查看批准结果或拒绝原因；如被拒绝，请按原因修改并重新提交凭证。",
  "Cloud Nine brings digital products together in one place. Explore the catalogue, check what is included and choose resources for your next project.": "Cloud Nine 汇集各种数字产品。浏览目录、查看包含内容，为您的下个项目选择资源。",
  "Contact support for questions about your personal information or to request a review of your account data. Do not include passwords or payment account credentials in support messages.": "如有个人信息疑问或需申请核查账户数据，请联系支持。请勿在消息中提供密码或支付账户凭据。",
  "Contact support with your order number and a description of the issue, including duplicate payments, an incorrect product or a delivery problem. Support will review your request and explain the available resolution.": "遇到重复付款、产品错误或交付问题时，请提供订单号和问题说明。支持团队会审核请求并说明可行的解决方式。",
  "Contact support with your order number if a product, payment or delivery needs attention. Check the refund policy and the product license for further information.": "如需处理产品、付款或交付问题，请提供订单号联系支持，并查看退款政策与产品许可。",
  "Each product may have its own license and permitted uses. Read the license and included information on the product page before purchasing. Purchasing a product does not automatically grant resale or redistribution rights.": "各产品可能有独立的许可和允许用途。购买前请阅读产品页面的许可与说明，购买并不自动授予转售或再分发权利。",
  "Follow the payment instructions shown at checkout. Upload clear payment evidence and check the amount and transaction reference before submitting.": "请按结账页的付款说明操作，上传清晰的付款凭证，提交前核对金额和交易参考号。",
  "If you are unsure about commercial use, client work, redistribution or any other use, contact support with the product name before purchasing or using the product.": "如不确定商业用途、客户项目、再分发或其他用途，请在购买或使用前提供产品名咨询支持。",
  "Keep your account credentials private and provide accurate order and payment information. Review the product description and license before placing an order.": "请保护账户凭据并提供准确的订单和付款信息，下单前请查看产品说明与许可。",
  "Language and theme preferences are stored in your browser. You can manage email and browser push preferences in Notifications. Website notification history remains available in your account.": "语言和主题偏好保存在浏览器中，邮件与浏览器推送可在通知页管理，网站通知记录仍保留在账户中。",
  "Payment evidence is reviewed manually. Payment approval and product delivery are separate steps. Products are delivered manually after approval; contact support about any delivery questions.": "付款凭证由人工审核，付款批准与产品交付是不同步骤，批准后由人工交付产品。如有交付疑问请联系支持。",
  "Payments are reviewed by an administrator and products are delivered manually after approval. You can contact our support team about your purchase using your order number.": "管理员审核付款，并在批准后人工交付产品。您可以提供订单号就购买问题联系支持团队。",
  "Read the product description, included files and license, then add your products to the cart.": "阅读产品说明、包含文件与许可，然后将商品加入购物车。",
  "Rejected payment evidence does not mean that a refund has been processed. A refund is not automatic. Contact support to confirm eligibility, the method and timing before making assumptions about a refund.": "凭证被拒绝并不代表退款已处理，退款不会自动进行。请联系支持确认资格、方式和时间。",
  "Sign in, check your cart and confirm your name and email at checkout.": "请登录、检查购物车，并在结账时确认姓名与邮箱。",
  "The marketplace stores account details, order information, submitted payment evidence and support messages to provide account access, review payments, deliver purchases and resolve issues.": "商城保存账户详情、订单信息、已提交的付款凭证和支持消息，用于提供账户访问、审核付款、交付购买内容和解决问题。",
